# REST API rules

- Use resource-oriented naming.
- Keep request and response DTOs explicit.
- Validate input with jakarta validation annotations.
- Return appropriate HTTP status codes.
- Do not expose internal exception messages to clients.
- Prefer pagination for collection endpoints that can grow.
- Keep API versioning consistent with the existing project strategy.
- Update OpenAPI annotations or API docs if the project uses them.
